+# 2026-10-01-central-public-diagnostics
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-01-central-public-diagnostics.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+LlmFailure增加可选公开diagnostic，保原请求身份/阶段/费用影响；登记现有原生history-checkout事件声明。
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-01-central-public-diagnostics
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:assistant/attempt"
+    previous: "2026-09-14-image-offload"
+    after: "ea9d4468207a7ce45195d859550f676e68f0bd4a7664d82458d9af1ffa813647"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:assistant/message"
+    previous: "2026-09-14-image-offload"
+    after: "88af212e2b8810880e5f0c2d1b39b693dc363a977d0233ed6cf259ce598089cf"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:llm/retry"
+    previous: "2026-09-14-image-offload"
+    after: "330d7b4cbbf770c92f0188d429114230ef199f072675a0c05702454347170378"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:session/history-checkout"
+    previous: null
+    after: "6915d75423f3de922625dba1785ff636edcc280d05ad5d67ca3be2145cf12972"
+    decision: same-version
+  - root: "event:turn/end"
+    previous: "2026-09-14-image-offload"
+    after: "2c9f86ca4b3fb951809248e4643c3bde40411486600004ea1108d58bca6ecadd"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+diagnostic为可选字段，旧attempt/message/retry/turnend记录仍有效，缺省保原无诊断的有界重试；有效unknown/false阻止新意图，非法字段fail-closed。history-checkout源与语义已由既有原生补丁提供，本次仅登记当前声明，不修改header/version/envelope，不新增执行或回放状态。Job registryId为可选短生命周期快照身份；产品观察事件均ignorable，缺失不推成功。
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+本地实际localhost HTTP/SSE 8项通过（后续最终清单含always旧策略回归）；原生Loop/Jobs/Loader7项通过；授权20会话隔离副本完整帧/内容hash一致且B1 timeout/Job未知分别投影。生产/GUI未重放，不以生成记录代行为验收。
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
